{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1450398-aberrant-mega-attributes-power-tags-and-negative-power-tags","id":1450398,"title":"[Aberrant] Mega-Attributes, Power Tags, and Negative Power Tags","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-30T22:33:16-07:00","id":1450398,"title":"[Aberrant] Mega-Attributes, Power Tags, and Negative Power Tags","content":"So as I was reading through the section on power tags, I noticed it mentioned that they can sometimes apply to Mega-Attributes and Mega-Edges as well as Quantum powers. There aren't very many negative power tags, but I was curious how those might work.<br /> <br /> Ramp up, for instance. Would that require a certain amount of rounds every use? Mega-Attributes don't have a set duration, so are they simply inapplicable? What about reduced duration, or Restricted?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","user":"IanWatson","date":". 05-31-2021, 10:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3052-blackshade10","name":"blackshade10","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-30T23:48:29-07:00","id":1450405,"title":"","content":"The book says they can apply as appropriate for the Qunatum ability, and the SG has final say. Therefore, I'd suggest the player and SG need to discuss how (or if) any given tag applies.<br /> <br /> For example, I could see Ramp Up applying to a Mega-Attribute, requiring however many rounds before it can be used, and then maybe remaining active as long as the character uses it each round. Or perhaps lasting Qunatum rounds. Whatever works. For Reduced Duration, assume that Mega-Attributes begin with something like Maintained duration, and step down from there. The nova may need to Concentrate (suffering the Complication), or impose a Quantum point cost to use the Mega-Attribute.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T10:33:58-07:00","id":1450466,"title":"","content":"some quick-and-dirty examples for you:<br /> <br /> Restricted Toughness: Achilles Heel. Doesn't work against silver. Doesn't work while sleeping.<br /> Restricted Mega-Strenght: Only works against animals. Only works under sunlight. Only works at night.<br /> Restricted Mega-Intellect: Only works for mathematics and calculations. DOESN't work with Math or calculations. XD<br /> Restricted Mega-Presence: Only works against women. Only works against men. Only works when people can't hear your voice. <br /> <br /> There are endless possibilities. XD<br /> Restricted is one of the best Tags, in my opinion. ^^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","name":"Timecrafter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1001_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T12:12:33-07:00","id":1450479,"title":"","content":"Restricted Mega-Strength: Requires you to spend 3 rounds standing still going &quot;OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOoooooooooooooooooooooooooohhhhhh hhhhh!&quot; like a Dragonball character focusing your power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-05T07:52:53-07:00","id":1451051,"title":"","content":"Meanwhile, another consideration might be a take on Restriction called &quot;Alteration&quot; or something: Whenever the Nova uses this power/Mega-Attribute, the Nova suffers the effect of Transformation &quot;whatever&quot; during that time. Figure for a -1 you'd take a Mid-level Transformation like...<br /> <br /> Sheriff can produce a Force Field but only as long as she's wearing the toy police badge her Dad gave her when she was 8 - and the badge is not protected by the Force Field. If somebody takes it or destroys it, she can't use her Force Field until she either reclaims the badge, picks another talisman (something requiring at least a scene AKA not something she can do in the middle of a fight) or pays the extra XP cost of her power without the cost break provided by the badge - AKA she gets over the weird psychological block (which is, again, not something she can do in the middle of a fight - unless she already has the necessary XP and the GM okays it).<br /> <br /> For a -2 you'd get a High-level Transformation like... Whenever Storm-lord unleashes Lightning (Quantum Attack) lightning rains down around him creating the Environmental Hazard Energy Emission in a Close area.<br /> <br /> In either case, Transformation effects lasts for either the duration of the Power or for Quantum rounds, whichever is greater. So if Storm-lord has a Quantum of 3 and fires two blasts in a two-round fight, Lightning will continue to rain down around him for an additional four rounds.<br /> <br /> Figure GMs should carefully consider what kind of Transformations work like this and make sure they're thing that would be real disadvantages. Like Permanent Power Force Field (effectively only while using Force Field) probably wouldn't be much of a disadvantage. Meanwhile Severe Psychological Disorder (Berserk Rage) attached to Mega-Strength would be appropriate but maybe a little more trouble for the party/game as a whole than it would be worth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-05T08:40:39-07:00","id":1451052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1450398-aberrant-mega-attributes-power-tags-and-negative-power-tags?p=1451051#post1451051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Meanwhile, another consideration might be a take on Restriction called &quot;Alteration&quot; or something: Whenever the Nova uses this power/Mega-Attribute, the Nova suffers the effect of Transformation &quot;whatever&quot; during that time. Figure for a -1 you'd take a Mid-level Transformation like [...] For a -2 you'd get a High-level Transformation like [...] In either case, Transformation effects lasts for either the duration of the Power or for Quantum rounds, whichever is greater.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just came here to say: I LOVE THIS IDEA. Really. This is the kind of thing that could be polished and added to the official rules. Bravo!!! \\o/","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","name":"Timecrafter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1001_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-08T22:14:42-07:00","id":1451415,"title":"","content":"Even a -1 tag would get you the same or more points than simply having the Transformation all the time. I would probably just call it a Transformation that you have a side effect when using certain powers.<br /> <br /> I think Charge would be pretty interesting on Mega-Might. Like you hit like a truck, but then you have to charge it up again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26881-pawsplay","name":"pawsplay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26881_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T14:32:52-07:00","id":1451911,"title":"","content":"At least in a campaign I run, here\u2019s a use of Ramp Up with Mega Might:<br /> <br /> ramp up(angry). You can only use mega-might after you get really angry. You keep it until you calm down. Usually the end of a fight, sometimes something else will snap you out of it. Also, you turn green.<br /> <br /> Also, I\u2019d add a negative tag that combines Smashing and either spread or area, or just say it adds more dice than usual to the Collateral Pool, specifically Raze or Scatter Being angry and oout of control, you are even harder on the environment than other Novas. Fortunately, no one ever seems to get injured by the accidental debris.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2678-spoonr","name":"SpoonR","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2678_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}